====== GL.iNet GL-A1300 (Slate Plus)======
~~NOTOC~~

/* This template is intended to be used via https://openwrt.org/meta/create_new_device_page . */

The GL.iNet GL-A1300 (Slate Plus) is a wireless travel router powered by a USB-C port. It has got two 10/100/1000Mbps LAN and one 10/100/1000Mbps WAN ethernet ports. The USB 3.0 Type A port can be used for USB modems.

{{media:gl.inet:gl-a1300.png|Generic Router}}


